+            // every image it ever built: the archive below was cleaned up, the images
+            // were not. Measured 2026-08-16 during a 120-application rollout -- 34 GB of
+            // images on the build server, 30 GB of them already transferred and never
+            // read again, and a CUDA-sized build died at "exporting layers" for want of
+            // disk.
+            //
+            // Deliberately here and not in finally: only a successful `docker load`
